 child would grow up to be  zeus who would eventually free his  siblings from the underworld defeat his  father and the rest of the titans and  then finally marry his sister hera and  become the ruler of olympus he would  also father several children with his  sister including some prominent marvel  characters like hercules and ares some  of the most kentucky based mythology in  the history of the world i could say  that because i used to live in kentucky  i was not one of those people like that  in kentucky but you go far enough east  you're going to find them now for his  powers zeus possesses incredible  strength now just to get an idea of how  strong he is not only was zeus able to  lift a mountain above his head but he's  put his strength on display against some  of marvel's strongest characters for  example zeus was able to overpower thor  with very little difficulty and was even  able to restrain thor's hammer mjolnir  but only for a brief moment he also  overpowers neymar and she-hulk knocks  out his son ares with one punch and  beats his son hercules nearly to death  now when zeus battled the hulk not only  was he victorious but he actually broke  the hulk's ribs and caused his lungs to  collapse and the fight between the two  of them which zeus won easily destroyed  a mountain now zeus was also able to  nearly knock over galactus with one of  his punches but it's worth noting that  galactus was in need of nourishment at  the time so he was not at like his peak  level of power but in addition to his  strength zeus has insane levels of  durability he was able to battle thor  for several months during which time he  would have taken an incredible amount of  damage and not only did he survive all  that damage but he actually emerged from  that battle with the victory he shrugged  off attacks from namor which doesn't  really matter monica rambo he also  shrugged off attacks from her ares and  nova and was completely unfazed by an  attack from thor silver surfer damon  hellstrom and cersei the eternal now  zeus was also able to survive a blast  that killed several sky fathers which is  the term used in marvel comics to refer  to the heads of the various divine  pantheons including zeus odin and those  guys and he was even able to survive the  detonation of a bomb capable of creating  a black hole so it's virtually  impossible to harm this guy now in  addition to his physical attributes zeus  is able to control the weather most  notably possessing the ability to summon  and manipulate lightning as he wishes  now one bolt of zeus's lightning was  enough to incapacitate monica rambo who  is herself a beyond omega level  character on another occasion zeus took  out the entire avengers team including  monica rambo she hulk and namor black  knight and thor all with a single bolt  of light zeus's lightning bolts can also  destroy mountains and even tear the  world apart now when zeus battled  galactus he was able to knock him down  with one lightning strike and has done  the same to thor and hulk he was also  able to illuminate a world of total  darkness now zeus has a variety of other  powers most of which come from his vast  mystical abilities these include  teleportation shape-shifting including  size manipulation the ability to project  himself into the astral plane and the  ability to give and take powers from  others zeus is also able to manipulate  matter being able to defy the laws of  physics by making rocks thrown at him  vanished from existence he's also a  powerful telekinetic and can actually  take away and restore the memories of  others now zeus is so powerful that we  even gain insight from other characters  who comment on his power level for  instance thanos once placed zeus  alongside odin who he's often compared  to in terms of power level as being  equal to marvel's cosmic abstracts and  another comparison dormammu one of the  most powerful villains in all of marvel  comics declared that zeus is actually  his 